stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_auth: checkAdmin()
    q_auth --> q_delete: supabaseAdmin.from("teams").delete().eq("id", teamId)
    q_auth --> q_error: checkAdmin throws
    q_delete --> q_db_error: delete error
    q_delete --> q_revalidate: delete success
    q_db_error --> q_error: throw error
    q_revalidate --> [*]: revalidatePath, return error null
    q_error --> [*]: return error message

    note right of q_delete
        INV-001: Admin check precedes deletion
        INV-002: Delete is scoped to exact team id
        INV-003: No input validation on teamId beyond admin check (accepts any string)
    end note
